     2993       ,output v-value-decimal15
     2994       ,output v-value-integer15
     2995       ,output cas-shft
     2996       ,output v-param-type15
     2997       ,INPUT-OUTPUT table-handle v-tth15
     2998       )  .
     2999   delete object v-tth15.
